Sbrtlby Jotes is a name the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Inquisition/index|Inquisition]]'s sources gave the [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Anouk Marchal|Marchal]] twins as one of the parties hunting keystone 14 ahead of the Party. He travels with hired henchmen. His name matches no major culture on [[Færrin]], so it comes from some smaller one; [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] is sure he is a devil.
